    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Creature Type\"><p>若你不穿着护甲时，你的甲壳让你的基础护甲等级变为 13+敏捷调整值。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">以一个动作，你能改变你甲壳的颜色来与你身边环境的颜色与纹理相匹配，这让你在这些环境中躲藏时，所进行的敏捷（隐匿）检定具有优势。</p></div><p>While you aren't wearing armor, your carapace gives you a base Armor Class of 13 + your Dexterity modifier.</p><p>As an action, you can change the color of your carapace to match the color and texture of your surroundings, giving you advantage on Dexterity (&amp;Reference[skill=Stealth]) checks made to @action[hide] in those surroundings.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
    "requirements": "Thri-kreen",
